00:01:42.676 --> 00:01:48.038
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:48.088 --> 00:01:49.316
Population!

19
00:01:50.405 --> 00:02:00.122
Did you know? John Snow's 1854 map of cholera cases in London is a famous early example of epidemiology!

20
